<title>UK: Commercial Bank of Korea sets $50 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Commercial Bank of Korea sets $50 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Bear Sterns Asia, CS First Boston, Dresdner SOuth East Asia, Merrill Lynch Far East and Sanwwa International Finance.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COMMERCIAL BANK OF KOREA</p>
<p> AMT    $50 MLN	 SPREAD     +30 BP    MATURITY    20.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 6M LIBOR  PAY DATE    20 DEC.96</p>
<p> ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES  15 BP     DENOMS (K)  50</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EURO MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
